The legal text is the Constitution of the Republic of Maldives and the statutes listed in the README, as published by the Attorney General's Office
of the Maldives on its legislation website:

  Source: https://mvlaw.gov.mv/en/legislations/6 (retrieved 29 October 2026), and the pages of the statutes in
  the README table, at https://mvlaw.gov.mv/en/legislations/<id> (retrieved 30 October 2026).

The laws of the Maldives are published on that website for public use. This repository makes no claim over them.

Changes made by Lexifina: the site's structured pages for each consolidated version were converted to one Markdown
file per article, with sub-items as lines; HTML was removed and whitespace was normalised. The wording is otherwise
the site's. Not an official copy.
